# Code owners of the protected paths (agent-ready standard v0, protected-path matrix).
# Replace every @FILL_IN_OWNER with a real user or team before required code-owner review is switched
# on. GitHub does not let an author approve their own pull request and waives nothing for them: once
# that review is on, a change to an owned path waits for a code owner other than its author. Where the
# agent writes under your own account and you are the only owner, leave the review off; protection
# there is the host hooks plus you reading the diff.
